---
// Decorative background wash for white-background sections.
// Uses percentage-sized radial gradients (not a blurred+clipped shape), so it always
// covers exactly 100% of the section's width/height and fades to fully transparent
// mathematically -- there is no hard edge for `overflow` to clip, at any section size.
//
// Usage: drop as the FIRST child inside a section with class="relative" (overflow-hidden
// optional, kept only as a safety net -- this layer never actually needs clipping).
// Give sibling content `class="relative z-10"` so it stacks above this layer.
---
<div class="section-blob-layer" aria-hidden="true"></div>
